  "title": "Caramel Apple Éclair Cake",
  "description": "This delicious no-bake dessert combines apples, vanilla pudding, and cinnamon graham crackers topped off with a caramel icing. It's best to refrigerate it for 24 hours to let the dessert have time to form a cake-like consistency.",
  "authors": [
